──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  DATA STRUCTURES (what the in-memory store holds)
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

BOOKINGS  (stored in BookingRepository.java)
───────────────────────────────────────────
  Field             Type      Description
  ──────────────    ──────    ────────────────────────────────────
  bookingId         String    Auto-generated  e.g. BK-A1B2C3
  guestId           String    Guest reference e.g. G001
  roomId            String    R001 | R002 | R003
  checkInDate       String    Format: YYYY-MM-DD
  checkOutDate      String    Format: YYYY-MM-DD
  status            String    PENDING | CONFIRMED | CHECKED_IN
                              CHECKED_OUT | CANCELLED
  numberOfGuests    int       1 – 10
  specialRequests   String    Free text, optional
  subtotal          double    roomRate × nights
  discount          double    5% of subtotal
  tax               double    10% of (subtotal − discount)
  total             double    (subtotal − discount) + tax

PAYMENTS  (stored in PaymentRepository.java)
────────────────────────────────────────────
  Field             Type      Description
  ──────────────    ──────    ────────────────────────────────────
  paymentId         String    Auto-generated  e.g. PY-AA1122
  bookingId         String    Links to a Booking
  amount            double    Total amount paid
  method            String    CARD | BANK_TRANSFER | CASH
  status            String    PENDING | COMPLETED | FAILED | REFUNDED
  transactionDate   String    Format: YYYY-MM-DD

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ROOM REFERENCE (hard-coded in Booking.java → getRoomRate())
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  Room ID    Room Type              Rate/Night   Max Guests
  ───────    ────────────────────   ──────────   ──────────
  R001       Standard Room          LKR 15,000.00      2
  R002       Deluxe Room            LKR 25,000.00      3
  R003       Presidential Suite     LKR 50,000.00      4

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  PRICING FORMULA
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  Subtotal  =  Rate per Night  ×  Number of Nights
  Discount  =  Subtotal × 5%
  Tax       =  (Subtotal − Discount) × 10%
  Total     =  (Subtotal − Discount) + Tax

  Example — Deluxe Room (LKR 25,000.00), 3 nights:
    Subtotal  =  LKR 25,000.00 × 3  =  LKR 75,000.00
    Discount  =  LKR 75,000.00 × 5% =  LKR 3,750.00
    Tax       =  LKR 71,250.00 × 10% = LKR 7,125.00
    Total     =  LKR 71,250.00 + LKR 7,125.00 = LKR 78,375.00

